### Admin Dashboard Statistics Tests

@baseUrl = https://localhost:7144
@adminToken = <YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE>

### 1. Get main dashboard statistics (3 key metrics)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/dashboard/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Expected Response (200 OK):
# {
#   "success": true,
#   "data": {
#     "totalActiveUsers": 5,
#     "newUsersThisMonth": 2,
#     "workoutLogsToday": 3,
#     "calculatedAt": "2025-12-05T14:30:00Z"
#   },
#   "message": "Dashboard statistics retrieved successfully"
# }

### Metrics Explanation:
# - totalActiveUsers: Total count of users with is_active = true
# - newUsersThisMonth: Count of users created from 1st of current month to today
# - workoutLogsToday: Count of workout logs created on today's date

###

### 2. Get detailed dashboard statistics (extended metrics)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/dashboard/stats/detailed
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Expected Response (200 OK):
# {
#   "success": true,
#   "data": {
#     "totalActiveUsers": 5,
#     "newUsersThisMonth": 2,
#     "workoutLogsToday": 3,
#     "nutritionLogsToday": 2,
#     "forumPostsThisMonth": 4,
#     "forumRepliesThisMonth": 8,
#     "openChallenges": 2,
#     "pendingChallengeSubmissions": 1,
#     "calculatedAt": "2025-12-05T14:30:00Z"
#   },
#   "message": "Detailed statistics retrieved successfully"
# }

### Additional Metrics:
# - nutritionLogsToday: Count of nutrition logs created today
# - forumPostsThisMonth: Count of forum posts created this month
# - forumRepliesThisMonth: Count of forum replies created this month
# - openChallenges: Count of challenges with status = Open
# - pendingChallengeSubmissions: Count of participations with status = PendingApproval

###

### 3. Get top content (Top 5 exercises and Top 5 forum categories)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/dashboard/top-content
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Expected Response (200 OK):
# {
#   "success": true,
#   "data": {
#     "topExercises": [
#       {
#         "exerciseId": 1,
#         "name": "Barbell Bench Press",
#         "muscleGroup": "Chest",
#         "difficultyLevel": "Intermediate",
#         "usageCount": 15
#       },
#       {
#         "exerciseId": 5,
#         "name": "Squats",
#         "muscleGroup": "Legs",
#         "difficultyLevel": "Intermediate",
#         "usageCount": 12
#       }
#     ],
#     "topForumCategories": [
#       {
#         "categoryId": 1,
#         "name": "Workout Tips",
#         "postCount": 5,
#         "replyCount": 12,
#         "totalActivity": 17
#       },
#       {
#         "categoryId": 2,
#         "name": "Nutrition & Diet",
#         "postCount": 3,
#         "replyCount": 8,
#         "totalActivity": 11
#       }
#     ]
#   },
#   "message": "Top content retrieved successfully"
# }

### Data Details:
# - topExercises: Top 5 exercises by usage count (sorted descending)
#   * exerciseId: Unique exercise identifier
#   * name: Exercise name
#   * muscleGroup: Target muscle group
#   * difficultyLevel: Difficulty level
#   * usageCount: Number of times used in ExerciseSessions
#
# - topForumCategories: Top 5 forum categories by activity (posts + replies, sorted descending)
#   * categoryId: Unique category identifier
#   * name: Category name
#   * postCount: Number of posts in this category (current month)
#   * replyCount: Number of replies to posts in this category (current month)
#   * totalActivity: Sum of postCount + replyCount

###

### Error Cases:

### Case 1: Missing Authentication
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/dashboard/stats

# Response (401 Unauthorized)

###

### Case 2: Non-Admin User (Customer role)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/dashboard/stats
Authorization: Bearer <CUSTOMER_JWT_TOKEN>

# Response (403 Forbidden)

###

### Case 3: Server Error
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/dashboard/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

# Response (500 Internal Server Error) - if database connection fails or unexpected error occurs

###
